Subject: [PATCH] feat(chat): drop the composer voice button

- Remove VoiceDialogueControls (record toggle + transcript overlay) from the chat composer .input-actions; the toolbar now holds only the send button.

- Clean up the pieces this orphans (imports, useComposerVoiceInput wiring, insertVoiceTranscriptIntoInput, and the --voice-overlay-mobile-bottom-offset var) so noUnusedLocals stays green.

- Skip the e2e spec that drove the removed toggle; VoiceDialogueControls is still unit-tested and still used by the group chat composer.

- Group chat composer and the settings menu realtime-voice entry are intentionally untouched.
